    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Warrior is an adventure, and platformer game that explores the perspective of multiple protagonists, all intertwined in a single, grand story.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/edaaa0374354e3ef74839ae8ba585e20.avif?t=1755083519\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/c63f1a3cc17362933f806b4966f637b4.poster.avif?t=1755083519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/c63f1a3cc17362933f806b4966f637b4.webm?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/c63f1a3cc17362933f806b4966f637b4.mp4?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each character wants to be the star of their own adventure. By taking control of each one, you'll discover that the villain and the hero are simply a matter of perspective.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/8a6f81fa71467deb5f5beb66a909e5eb.avif?t=1755083519\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/94dd55de5602463f0b5009dcd3d9dc93.poster.avif?t=1755083519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/94dd55de5602463f0b5009dcd3d9dc93.webm?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/94dd55de5602463f0b5009dcd3d9dc93.mp4?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In addition to unique abilities, each character carries their own difficulties and obstacles. Overcoming them will require thinking outside the box.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/cf2844cfa9a0b472cb9404edd4fe74a8.avif?t=1755083519\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/b5da834f086808aeef7ca52b4c18df12.poster.avif?t=1755083519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/b5da834f086808aeef7ca52b4c18df12.webm?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/b5da834f086808aeef7ca52b4c18df12.mp4?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dive into a universe full of details and secrets. Explore the environment, meet unique creatures, and decipher ancient runes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/77adc424f8dd579c6c3887aec4af4ae8.avif?t=1755083519\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/d9bee1798ef25dae4f00bfcbb24014b0.poster.avif?t=1755083519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/d9bee1798ef25dae4f00bfcbb24014b0.webm?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/d9bee1798ef25dae4f00bfcbb24014b0.mp4?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Encounter unique and charismatic characters throughout your journey and understand their motivations and desires.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/6e2208fd5b03bcdcbe03f947932beec2.avif?t=1755083519\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/a0f1f74f5ac097e3842583023a5a77fe.poster.avif?t=1755083519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/a0f1f74f5ac097e3842583023a5a77fe.webm?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/a0f1f74f5ac097e3842583023a5a77fe.mp4?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Terrifying creatures of unimaginable size await you underground. Defeating them won\u2019t be an easy task.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/e20dd4cd516073f432f369004f06b077.avif?t=1755083519\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/45dbe048979b6124abb5c6422f510266.poster.avif?t=1755083519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/45dbe048979b6124abb5c6422f510266.webm?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/45dbe048979b6124abb5c6422f510266.mp4?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Piece together fragments of the story from each character\u2019s perspective through dialogues and ancient ruins. Can you uncover the truth?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Warrior is an adventure, and platformer game that explores the perspective of multiple protagonists, all intertwined in a single, grand story.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/edaaa0374354e3ef74839ae8ba585e20.avif?t=1755083519\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/c63f1a3cc17362933f806b4966f637b4.poster.avif?t=1755083519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/c63f1a3cc17362933f806b4966f637b4.webm?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/c63f1a3cc17362933f806b4966f637b4.mp4?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each character wants to be the star of their own adventure. By taking control of each one, you'll discover that the villain and the hero are simply a matter of perspective.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/8a6f81fa71467deb5f5beb66a909e5eb.avif?t=1755083519\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/94dd55de5602463f0b5009dcd3d9dc93.poster.avif?t=1755083519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/94dd55de5602463f0b5009dcd3d9dc93.webm?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/94dd55de5602463f0b5009dcd3d9dc93.mp4?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In addition to unique abilities, each character carries their own difficulties and obstacles. Overcoming them will require thinking outside the box.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/cf2844cfa9a0b472cb9404edd4fe74a8.avif?t=1755083519\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/b5da834f086808aeef7ca52b4c18df12.poster.avif?t=1755083519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/b5da834f086808aeef7ca52b4c18df12.webm?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/b5da834f086808aeef7ca52b4c18df12.mp4?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dive into a universe full of details and secrets. Explore the environment, meet unique creatures, and decipher ancient runes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/77adc424f8dd579c6c3887aec4af4ae8.avif?t=1755083519\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/d9bee1798ef25dae4f00bfcbb24014b0.poster.avif?t=1755083519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/d9bee1798ef25dae4f00bfcbb24014b0.webm?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/d9bee1798ef25dae4f00bfcbb24014b0.mp4?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Encounter unique and charismatic characters throughout your journey and understand their motivations and desires.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/6e2208fd5b03bcdcbe03f947932beec2.avif?t=1755083519\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/a0f1f74f5ac097e3842583023a5a77fe.poster.avif?t=1755083519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/a0f1f74f5ac097e3842583023a5a77fe.webm?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/a0f1f74f5ac097e3842583023a5a77fe.mp4?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Terrifying creatures of unimaginable size await you underground. Defeating them won\u2019t be an easy task.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/e20dd4cd516073f432f369004f06b077.avif?t=1755083519\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/45dbe048979b6124abb5c6422f510266.poster.avif?t=1755083519\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/45dbe048979b6124abb5c6422f510266.webm?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/45dbe048979b6124abb5c6422f510266.mp4?t=1755083519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Piece together fragments of the story from each character\u2019s perspective through dialogues and ancient ruins. Can you uncover the truth?</p>",
